{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And he met him at the mountain of Elohim, and kissed him.</b> They said in the Midrash: this is what the verse means (Song of Songs 8:1): ״מי יתנך כאח לי יונק שדי אמי אמצאך בחוץ אשקך״ — and it is written (Psalms 85): ״חסד ואמת נפגשו צדק ושלום נשקו״. חסד — this is Aharon, as it says (Deuteronomy 33:8): ״תומיך ואוריך לאיש חסידך״; and אמת — this is Moshe, as it says (Numbers 12:7): ״בכל ביתי נאמן הוא״; צדק — this is Moshe, as it says (Deuteronomy 33:21): ״צדקת ה' עשה״ and so forth; and שלום — this is Aharon, as it says (Malachi 2:6): ״בשלום ובמישור הלך אתי״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:56:13.106369139Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}